{"strongs": "H2670", "word": "חָפְשִׁי", "translit": "choph.shi", "root": "חפף", "morph": "H:A", "pos": "adjective", "gloss": "free", "definition": "חָפְשִׁי adjective free (Late Hebrew id. ) — ׳ ח Exod 21:5 + 10 t. + Ps 88:6 plural חָפְשִׁים Isa 58:6 + 4 t. — 1. free from slavery: of Hebrew bondslave (male or female) set free in 7th year Exod 21:2 ; Exod 21:5 ( J E ), Deut 15:12 ; Deut 15:13 ; Deut 15:18 , compare Jer 34:9 ; Jer 34:10 ; Jer 34:11 ; Jer 34:14 ; Jer 34:16 of slave (male or female) set free on account of injury done Exod 21:26 ; Exod 21:27 ( J E ); מֵאֲדֹנָיו ׳ עֶבֶד ח Job 3:19 a slave is free from his master (i.e. in Sh®°ôl ); but בַּמֵּתִים חָפְשִׁי Ps 88:6 among the dead I am free (i.e. adrift, cut off from Yahweh's remembrance); more generally, שַׁלַּח רְצוּצִים חָפְשִׁים Isa 58:6 to let oppressed ones go free . 2. free from taxes, obligations, etc. אֵת בֵּית אָבִיו יַעֲשֶׂה חָפְשִׁי בְּיְשְׂרָאֵל 1Sam 17:25 his father's house will he make free in Israel .", "definition_html": "<h1><entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB3025')\">BDB3025</entry> [<entry onclick=\"sn('H2670')\">H2670</entry>]</h1><div class=\"navigation\"><entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB3024')\">BDB3024</entry> | BIBLICAL HEBREW | <entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB3026')\">BDB3026</entry></div><p> <bdbheb>חָפְשִׁי</bdbheb> <b>adjective</b> <highlightword>free</highlightword> (Late Hebrew <highlight>id.</highlight>) — <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>ח</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Exod 21:5\" b=\"2\" cBegin=\"21\" vBegin=\"5\" cEnd=\"21\" vEnd=\"5\" onclick=\"bcv(2,21,5)\">Exod 21:5</ref> + 10 t. + <ref ref=\"Ps 88:6\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"88\" vBegin=\"6\" cEnd=\"88\" vEnd=\"6\" onclick=\"bcv(19,88,6)\">Ps 88:6</ref> plural <bdbheb>חָפְשִׁים</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Isa 58:6\" b=\"23\" cBegin=\"58\" vBegin=\"6\" cEnd=\"58\" vEnd=\"6\" onclick=\"bcv(23,58,6)\">Isa 58:6</ref> + 4 t. — <div class=\"point\"><b>1.</b> <highlight>free</highlight> from slavery: of Hebrew bondslave (male or female) set free in 7th year <ref ref=\"Exod 21:2\" b=\"2\" cBegin=\"21\" vBegin=\"2\" cEnd=\"21\" vEnd=\"2\" onclick=\"bcv(2,21,2)\">Exod 21:2</ref>; <ref ref=\"Exod 21:5\" b=\"2\" cBegin=\"21\" vBegin=\"5\" cEnd=\"21\" vEnd=\"5\" onclick=\"bcv(2,21,5)\">Exod 21:5</ref> (<lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('J')\"><reflink>J</reflink></lookup><lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('E')\"><reflink>E</reflink></lookup>), <ref ref=\"Deut 15:12\" b=\"5\" cBegin=\"15\" vBegin=\"12\" cEnd=\"15\" vEnd=\"12\" onclick=\"bcv(5,15,12)\">Deut 15:12</ref>; <ref ref=\"Deut 15:13\" b=\"5\" cBegin=\"15\" vBegin=\"13\" cEnd=\"15\" vEnd=\"13\" onclick=\"bcv(5,15,13)\">Deut 15:13</ref>; <ref ref=\"Deut 15:18\" b=\"5\" cBegin=\"15\" vBegin=\"18\" cEnd=\"15\" vEnd=\"18\" onclick=\"bcv(5,15,18)\">Deut 15:18</ref>, compare <ref ref=\"Jer 34:9\" b=\"24\" cBegin=\"34\" vBegin=\"9\" cEnd=\"34\" vEnd=\"9\" onclick=\"bcv(24,34,9)\">Jer 34:9</ref>; <ref ref=\"Jer 34:10\" b=\"24\" cBegin=\"34\" vBegin=\"10\" cEnd=\"34\" vEnd=\"10\" onclick=\"bcv(24,34,10)\">Jer 34:10</ref>; <ref ref=\"Jer 34:11\" b=\"24\" cBegin=\"34\" vBegin=\"11\" cEnd=\"34\" vEnd=\"11\" onclick=\"bcv(24,34,11)\">Jer 34:11</ref>; <ref ref=\"Jer 34:14\" b=\"24\" cBegin=\"34\" vBegin=\"14\" cEnd=\"34\" vEnd=\"14\" onclick=\"bcv(24,34,14)\">Jer 34:14</ref>; <ref ref=\"Jer 34:16\" b=\"24\" cBegin=\"34\" vBegin=\"16\" cEnd=\"34\" vEnd=\"16\" onclick=\"bcv(24,34,16)\">Jer 34:16</ref> of slave (male or female) set free on account of injury done <ref ref=\"Exod 21:26\" b=\"2\" cBegin=\"21\" vBegin=\"26\" cEnd=\"21\" vEnd=\"26\" onclick=\"bcv(2,21,26)\">Exod 21:26</ref>; <ref ref=\"Exod 21:27\" b=\"2\" cBegin=\"21\" vBegin=\"27\" cEnd=\"21\" vEnd=\"27\" onclick=\"bcv(2,21,27)\">Exod 21:27</ref> (<lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('J')\"><reflink>J</reflink></lookup><lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('E')\"><reflink>E</reflink></lookup>); <bdbheb>מֵאֲדֹנָיו</bdbheb> <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>עֶבֶד ח</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Job 3:19\" b=\"18\" cBegin=\"3\" vBegin=\"19\" cEnd=\"3\" vEnd=\"19\" onclick=\"bcv(18,3,19)\">Job 3:19</ref> <highlight>a slave is free from his master</highlight> (i.e. in <transliteration>Sh®°ôl</transliteration>); but <bdbheb>בַּמֵּתִים</bdbheb> <bdbheb>חָפְשִׁי</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Ps 88:6\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"88\" vBegin=\"6\" cEnd=\"88\" vEnd=\"6\" onclick=\"bcv(19,88,6)\">Ps 88:6</ref> <highlight>among the dead</highlight> I am <highlight>free</highlight> (i.e. adrift, cut off from Yahweh's remembrance); more generally, <bdbheb>שַׁלַּח רְצוּצִים חָפְשִׁים</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Isa 58:6\" b=\"23\" cBegin=\"58\" vBegin=\"6\" cEnd=\"58\" vEnd=\"6\" onclick=\"bcv(23,58,6)\">Isa 58:6</ref> <highlight>to let oppressed ones go free</highlight>. </div><div class=\"point\"><b>2.</b> <highlight>free</highlight> from taxes, obligations, etc. <bdbheb>אֵת בֵּית אָבִיו יַעֲשֶׂה חָפְשִׁי בְּיְשְׂרָאֵל</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"1Sam 17:25\" b=\"9\" cBegin=\"17\" vBegin=\"25\" cEnd=\"17\" vEnd=\"25\" onclick=\"bcv(9,17,25)\">1Sam 17:25</ref> <highlight>his father's house will he make free in Israel</highlight>. </p></div><hr>", "references": [{"raw": "Exod 21:5", "book": "EXO", "chapter": 21, "verse": 5}, {"raw": "Ps 88:6", "book": "PSA", "chapter": 88, "verse": 6}, {"raw": "Isa 58:6", "book": "ISA", "chapter": 58, "verse": 6}, {"raw": "Exod 21:2", "book": "EXO", "chapter": 21, "verse": 2}, {"raw": "Deut 15:12", "book": "DEU", "chapter": 15, "verse": 12}, {"raw": "Deut 15:13", "book": "DEU", "chapter": 15, "verse": 13}, {"raw": "Deut 15:18", "book": "DEU", "chapter": 15, "verse": 18}, {"raw": "Jer 34:9", "book": "JER", "chapter": 34, "verse": 9}, {"raw": "Jer 34:10", "book": "JER", "chapter": 34, "verse": 10}, {"raw": "Jer 34:11", "book": "JER", "chapter": 34, "verse": 11}, {"raw": "Jer 34:14", "book": "JER", "chapter": 34, "verse": 14}, {"raw": "Jer 34:16", "book": "JER", "chapter": 34, "verse": 16}, {"raw": "Exod 21:26", "book": "EXO", "chapter": 21, "verse": 26}, {"raw": "Exod 21:27", "book": "EXO", "chapter": 21, "verse": 27}, {"raw": "Job 3:19", "book": "JOB", "chapter": 3, "verse": 19}